+- First `m nothing` that passes (2026-11-06): the soong errors were
+  - a frameworks/base worktree left half checked out by an interrupted
+    force-sync (57k staged deletions; `git reset --hard HEAD` there);
+  - Android 15 fsgen: PRODUCT_COPY_FILES under lib/ become
+    prebuilt_renderscript_bitcode modules installed at lib64, so blobs in
+    both lib and lib64 collided; those 105 libraries are now `-` modules
+    with DISABLE_DEPS (as msm8996-common); vr.default dropped (AOSP builds it);
+  - shims/ duplicated hardware/lineage/compat's libbase_shim and
+    libcutils_shim (the IMS blobs only need LogMessage C1, compat has it);
+  - gps/ replaced by msm8996-common's 22.2 GPS HAL (gnss@2.0 service,
+    batching, geofence), axon7's gps/etc kept;
+  - PRODUCT_PACKAGES gone in 22.2 removed: Snap, CNE client, services-ext,
+    libqsap_sdk, libQWiFiSoftApCfg, libicuuc.vendor, libstdc++.vendor.
+  vendor/zte needs its makefiles regenerated with this tree's
+  setup-makefiles.sh (committed on branch axon7-lineage-22.2 in the build
+  tree's vendor/zte). Soong analysis peaks at ~28 GB RAM + ~5 GB swap: one
+  run on the 31 GB + 7 GB swap container was OOM-killed.
+
